</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">2. Of the seven gifts (wisdom, understanding, counsel, fortitude, knowledge, piety, and fear of the Lord), which one do you feel you need most right now in your life? Think of a specific situation — a decision, a struggle, a relationship — and explain why that gift would make a difference.</p>
<p class="question-block__p">Do not just name the gift. Describe the concrete situation where you need it, and imagine what it would look like if the Holy Spirit gave you that gift in abundance.</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
