</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">3. The fruits of the Spirit are &laquo;love, joy, peace, patience, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness, self-control&raquo; (Gal 5:22-23). Do a personal inventory: put a ✓ next to the three fruits you see most in your life, and a ? next to the three that need the most growth. For one of the &laquo;?&raquo; fruits, describe a situation this week where you could practice it.</p>
<p class="question-block__p">Be brave enough to be honest. The point is not to feel bad about yourself but to know where to focus your prayer and effort.</p>
