<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">5. If you truly believed that your body is a &laquo;temple of the Holy Spirit&raquo; (1 Cor 6:19) — that the living God dwells within you, here and now — what is one concrete decision you would make this week to honor that temple and give the Spirit more room to act?</p>
<p class="question-block__p">Be specific. Not &laquo;I will be a better person,&raquo; but something like: &laquo;I will spend five minutes in silence before bed, inviting the Spirit to speak,&raquo; or &laquo;I will forgive my brother and tell him so,&raquo; or &laquo;I will turn off my phone for an hour and pay attention to the people in front of me.&raquo;</p>
