<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">6. At Pentecost, fearful apostles became bold witnesses. What is the biggest fear holding you back from living and sharing your faith more openly? Ask the Holy Spirit directly for the gift of fortitude — and write down what you think he might be saying to you in response.</p>
<p class="question-block__p">Fear is not a sign of weak faith. The apostles had faith and were still afraid — until the Spirit filled them. Name your fear, lay it before the Spirit, and listen.</p>
