<h3>Practical Activities</h3>

<h4>A. Fruit Inventory</h4>
<p>Write out the list of the fruits of the Spirit from Galatians 5:22-23. Next to each one, place a symbol: ✓ if you see this fruit growing in your life, ? if you are not sure, ✗ if you feel it needs urgent attention. Then choose ONE fruit marked ✗ or ? and write a specific, measurable action you will take this week to cultivate it — with the Spirit's help.</p>
