<h4>B. Meditate on the &laquo;Veni Sancte Spiritus&raquo; Sequence</h4>
<p>Find the text of the &laquo;Veni Sancte Spiritus&raquo; sequence online (it is the Pentecost sequence from the Roman Missal). Read it slowly, aloud if possible. Pause after each verse. Underline or copy out the three phrases that touch you most deeply. What are they asking of the Holy Spirit? Write a short paragraph: why did those particular phrases stand out to you today?</p>
