<h4>C. Daily Invocation to the Holy Spirit</h4>
<p>For one week, before every significant decision — before an exam, before a difficult conversation, before making a plan, before responding to someone who has hurt you — pause, breathe, and say (out loud or in your heart): &laquo;Come, Holy Spirit.&raquo; Keep a simple log below:</p>

