<h4>D. Read Acts 2:1-41 — The Full Pentecost Account</h4>
<p>Read Acts 2:1-41 in one sitting. It takes about five minutes. Then, using your imagination and the text, answer these questions: what did the room smell like? What sounds surrounded the apostles? How did Peter&apos;s voice sound different from what we know of him before? What would you have done if you were in the crowd that day? Write a paragraph describing your imagined experience.</p>
