<h4>E. Discover Your Charisms</h4>
<p>Take five minutes of silence. Ask the Holy Spirit to show you what gifts he has given you to serve others — not the spectacular ones necessarily, but the real ones. Write down whatever thoughts, memories, or images come to mind. What do people thank you for? What comes naturally to you that others find hard? What kind of service gives you deep joy? These are clues to your charisms.</p>
