<h4>F. Study a Symbol</h4>
<p>The Catechism lists multiple symbols of the Holy Spirit: water, anointing, fire, cloud and light, the seal, the hand, the finger, and the dove (CCC 694-701). Choose the symbol that resonates most with you right now. Find the corresponding CCC paragraphs. Read them. Then draw the symbol on a piece of paper and, around it, write words and phrases that express what the Spirit means to you through that symbol.</p>
